{"code":"bbc","quarters":[{"id":"2026-01","title":"Mandamei Surgo dohot tano Kristus di Bagasan Pilippi dohot Kolosse","description":"Ingot ma sada ulaon na borat situtu na dung diulahon ho. Aha do na mambahen i borat? Alani pangidoan na balga situtu do, manang alani partingkian na otik, manang alani na dua i? Songon dia do parangem maradophon ulaon i? Manang na olo do ala ni angka donganmu na raphon ho di ulaon i? Manang ala, na so tarula situtu do idaon ulaon i?","human_date":"Januari · Februari · Maret 2026","start_date":"27/12/2025","end_date":"27/03/2026","color_primary":"#2E4161","color_primary_dark":"#1E2C44","splash":true,"credits":[],"lessons":[{"number":1,"title":"Dilelei alai Ndang Ditadingkon","start_date":"27/12/2025","end_date":"02/01/2026"},{"number":2,"title":"Dalanna Marlas ni roha dohot Martangiang","start_date":"03/01/2026","end_date":"09/01/2026"},{"number":3,"title":"Mangolu manang Mate","start_date":"10/01/2026","end_date":"16/01/2026"},{"number":4,"title":"Parsaoran di bagasan Haserepon","start_date":"17/01/2026","end_date":"23/01/2026"},{"number":5,"title":"Marsinondang songon Panondang di na Holom","start_date":"24/01/2026","end_date":"30/01/2026"},{"number":6,"title":"Marhaporseaon na Gok di Kristus","start_date":"31/01/2026","end_date":"06/02/2026"},{"number":7,"title":"Pangisi ni Banua Ginjang","start_date":"07/02/2026","end_date":"13/02/2026"},{"number":8,"title":"Hasurungan ni Kristus","start_date":"14/02/2026","end_date":"20/02/2026"},{"number":9,"title":"Pardengganan dohot Pangaropan","start_date":"21/02/2026","end_date":"27/02/2026"},{"number":10,"title":"Polin di bagasan Kristus","start_date":"28/02/2026","end_date":"06/03/2026"},{"number":11,"title":"Mangolu Raphon Kristus","start_date":"07/03/2026","end_date":"13/03/2026"},{"number":12,"title":"Mangolu Raphon Dongan","start_date":"14/03/2026","end_date":"20/03/2026"},{"number":13,"title":"Jongjong di Bagasan nasa Hatigoran","start_date":"21/03/2026","end_date":"27/03/2026"}]},{"id